{"seq":3,"slug":"factor-models","title":"因子模型与预期收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/theory-foundations/factor-models","wordCount":2523,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"因子模型与预期收益\">因子模型与预期收益</h1><blockquote>\n<p>Fama-French 三因子/五因子、AQR 因子溢价、因子时序变化、如何用因子指导资产配置。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>因子模型把资产的预期收益分解为对若干系统性风险因子的暴露（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）与相应风险溢价之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[R_i] - r_f = \\sum_k \\beta_{i,k} \\cdot E[F_k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>因子（Factor）</strong>：能系统性解释横截面收益差异的共同风险源，如市场、规模、价值、动量；</li>\n<li><strong>因子溢价（Factor Premium）</strong>：承担某因子暴露所获得的预期超额收益；</li>\n<li><strong>因子暴露（β）</strong>：资产对该因子变动的敏感度，是配置与风险归因的基本单位。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模型从 CAPM 的单因子逐步扩展到三因子、五因子与 AQR 框架，反映学界对&quot;什么驱动预期收益&quot;认识的演进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-capm-到多因子世界\">从 CAPM 到多因子世界</h2><p>CAPM 告诉我们只有一个因子——市场风险——驱动资产预期收益。但 1980 年代以来的大量实证研究表明，多个系统性因子可以解释横截面收益差异。这催生了<strong>多因子资产定价模型</strong>，从根本上改变了我们理解和实施资产配置的方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从单因子到多因子的逻辑\">从单因子到多因子的逻辑</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>因子数</th>\n<th>核心突破</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CAPM</td>\n<td>1964</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>只有市场 β 获得补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>APT</td>\n<td>1976</td>\n<td>K</td>\n<td>多个系统性因子可定价，但未指定哪些</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fama-French 三因子</td>\n<td>1993</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>规模+价值 解释 CAPM 异象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carhart 四因子</td>\n<td>1997</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>加入动量因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fama-French 五因子</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>加入盈利能力+投资</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>q-factor 模型</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>从投资 CAPM 推导</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fama-french-三因子模型\">Fama-French 三因子模型</h2><h3 id=\"模型结构\">模型结构</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[R_i] - r_f = \\beta_i^{MKT}(E[R_m] - r_f) + \\beta_i^{SMB} \\cdot E[SMB] + \\beta_i^{HML} \\cdot E[HML]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个因子的构造：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>构造方式</th>\n<th>经济直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MKT</td>\n<td>Market excess return</td>\n<td>市场组合收益减无风险利率</td>\n<td>补偿系统性市场风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMB</td>\n<td>Small Minus Big</td>\n<td>小市值组合减大市值组合</td>\n<td>小公司面临更多经营风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HML</td>\n<td>High Minus Low</td>\n<td>高 B/M 组合减低 B/M 组合</td>\n<td>价值股面临更多财务困境风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"因子构造的具体方法\">因子构造的具体方法</h3><p>Fama 和 French 使用 2×3 双重排序：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[NYSE/AMEX/NASDAQ 全部股票] --&gt; B[按市值中位数分为 Small / Big]&#10;    A --&gt; C[按 B/M 30%/70% 分位数分为 Value / Neutral / Growth]&#10;    B --&gt; D[6 个组合: S/V, S/N, S/G, B/V, B/N, B/G]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;SMB = 1/3(S/V + S/N + S/G) - 1/3(B/V + B/N + B/G)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;HML = 1/2(S/V + B/V) - 1/2(S/G + B/G)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[NYSE/AMEX/NASDAQ 全部股票] --&gt; B[按市值中位数分为 Small / Big]\n    A --&gt; C[按 B/M 30%/70% 分位数分为 Value / Neutral / Growth]\n    B --&gt; D[6 个组合: S/V, S/N, S/G, B/V, B/N, B/G]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[\"SMB = 1/3(S/V + S/N + S/G) - 1/3(B/V + B/N + B/G)\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"HML = 1/2(S/V + B/V) - 1/2(S/G + B/G)\"]</pre><h3 id=\"三因子模型的解释力\">三因子模型的解释力</h3><p>在美国股市 1963-2023 年的样本中，三因子模型将 CAPM 残差从约 3-5% 年化降低到约 1-2%，截面 R² 从约 70% 提升到约 90%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fama-french-五因子模型\">Fama-French 五因子模型</h2><p>2015 年，Fama 和 French 在三因子基础上增加两个因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[R_i] - r_f = \\beta_i^{MKT} \\cdot MKT + \\beta_i^{SMB} \\cdot SMB + \\beta_i^{HML} \\cdot HML + \\beta_i^{RMW} \\cdot RMW + \\beta_i^{CMA} \\cdot CMA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>新因子</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>构造</th>\n<th>经济直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RMW</td>\n<td>Robust Minus Weak</td>\n<td>高营运利润率减低营运利润率</td>\n<td>盈利能力强的公司更有价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CMA</td>\n<td>Conservative Minus Aggressive</td>\n<td>低投资率减高投资率</td>\n<td>保守投资的公司预期收益更高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五因子-vs-三因子\">五因子 vs 三因子</h3><p>五因子模型的争议点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加入 RMW 和 CMA 后，HML 变得冗余（被其他因子解释）</li>\n<li>五因子模型依然无法解释动量效应</li>\n<li>新增因子是否代表&quot;风险&quot;还是&quot;定价错误&quot;仍有争论</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"aqr-因子框架\">AQR 因子框架</h2><p>Cliff Asness 领导的 AQR Capital Management 提出了更广泛的因子框架，将因子拓展到多资产类别：</p>\n<h3 id=\"aqr-核心因子\">AQR 核心因子</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>股票</th>\n<th>债券</th>\n<th>商品</th>\n<th>外汇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价值（Value）</td>\n<td>B/M, E/P</td>\n<td>期限利差</td>\n<td>5年期货roll</td>\n<td>购买力平价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动量（Momentum）</td>\n<td>12-1月收益</td>\n<td>收益率变化</td>\n<td>12-1月收益</td>\n<td>12-1月收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套利（Carry）</td>\n<td>股息率</td>\n<td>收益率水平</td>\n<td>roll yield</td>\n<td>利率差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防御/质量（Quality）</td>\n<td>低beta×盈利</td>\n<td>低久期×高评级</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"因子溢价的历史规模\">因子溢价的历史规模</h3><p>AQR 的 &quot;Factors from Scratch&quot;（2024 更新）报告中，1927-2023 年美国股市各因子的年化溢价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>年化超额收益</th>\n<th>Sharpe Ratio</th>\n<th>t 统计量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场（MKT）</td>\n<td>7.5%</td>\n<td>0.40</td>\n<td>3.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价值（HML）</td>\n<td>4.5%</td>\n<td>0.35</td>\n<td>3.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规模（SMB）</td>\n<td>2.8%</td>\n<td>0.22</td>\n<td>2.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动量（MOM）</td>\n<td>7.8%</td>\n<td>0.55</td>\n<td>5.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盈利（RMW）</td>\n<td>3.3%</td>\n<td>0.48</td>\n<td>4.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低波动（BAB）</td>\n<td>8.1%</td>\n<td>0.62</td>\n<td>6.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"因子溢价的经济解释\">因子溢价的经济解释</h2><h3 id=\"风险解释-vs-行为解释\">风险解释 vs 行为解释</h3><p>因子溢价为何存在？学术界存在两大流派：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[因子溢价] --&gt; B[风险解释]&#10;    A --&gt; C[行为解释]&#10;    B --&gt; D[补偿系统性风险暴露]&#10;    B --&gt; E[经济衰退时损失更大]&#10;    B --&gt; F[流动性风险]&#10;    C --&gt; G[投资者认知偏差]&#10;    C --&gt; H[制度约束]&#10;    C --&gt; I[有限套利]\">flowchart LR\n    A[因子溢价] --&gt; B[风险解释]\n    A --&gt; C[行为解释]\n    B --&gt; D[补偿系统性风险暴露]\n    B --&gt; E[经济衰退时损失更大]\n    B --&gt; F[流动性风险]\n    C --&gt; G[投资者认知偏差]\n    C --&gt; H[制度约束]\n    C --&gt; I[有限套利]</pre><p><strong>风险解释阵营</strong>（Fama, Cochrane）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>价值溢价：价值股是&quot;受困&quot;企业，在经济衰退时表现更差</li>\n<li>规模溢价：小公司流动性差，融资困难</li>\n<li>动量：本质上是对制度变迁的风险暴露</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>行为解释阵营</strong>（Shiller, Lakonishok, DeBondt）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>价值溢价：投资者过度外推历史增长率</li>\n<li>动量：投资者对信息反应不足，然后过度反应</li>\n<li>低波动率：彩票偏好——高波动率股票被过度追捧</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"实务立场-因子溢价是否会持续\">实务立场：因子溢价是否会持续？</h3><p>判断因子溢价是否可持续的三个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>评估方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>样本外复制</td>\n<td>全球其他市场也存在吗？</td>\n<td>检查国际数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发现后衰减</td>\n<td>发表后溢价缩水了吗？</td>\n<td>比较发表前后的溢价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济合理性</td>\n<td>有合理的风险/行为解释吗？</td>\n<td>学术辩论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>McLean 和 Pontiff（2016）的研究显示：学术发表后，因子溢价平均衰减约 32%（发现后到发表前）和 58%（发表后），但多数因子仍然显著不为零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因子的时序变化与周期性\">因子的时序变化与周期性</h2><h3 id=\"因子有自己的-周期\">因子有自己的&quot;周期&quot;</h3><p>因子溢价不是恒定的——它们有自己的牛市和熊市：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>有利环境</th>\n<th>不利环境</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价值</td>\n<td>经济复苏初期</td>\n<td>流动性泛滥、成长股牛市</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动量</td>\n<td>趋势明确的市场</td>\n<td>市场反转（如 2009 年 3 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>经济放缓、不确定性高</td>\n<td>强劲复苏、风险偏好高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规模</td>\n<td>经济扩张中后期</td>\n<td>流动性紧缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"价值因子的-失落十年\">价值因子的&quot;失落十年&quot;</h3><p>2017-2023 年间，HML 因子经历了有记录以来最大且最长的回撤，累计跑输成长股约 50%+。许多投资者质疑&quot;价值是否已死&quot;。然而 2024-2025 年，随着利率正常化和 AI 估值泡沫的局部消化，价值因子出现了强劲回归，尤其在国际市场。</p>\n<p>这种周期性是因子投资的核心挑战——你需要足够长的持有期来穿越因子的低谷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"如何用因子指导资产配置\">如何用因子指导资产配置</h2><h3 id=\"因子配置-vs-资产类别配置\">因子配置 vs 资产类别配置</h3><p>传统配置以<strong>资产类别</strong>为维度（股/债/商品/不动产），现代配置越来越多地以<strong>因子</strong>为维度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 传统视角&#10;        A[股票 60%] --&gt; D[组合]&#10;        B[债券 30%] --&gt; D&#10;        C[商品 10%] --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 因子视角&#10;        E[市场因子] --&gt; I[组合]&#10;        F[价值因子] --&gt; I&#10;        G[动量因子] --&gt; I&#10;        H[套利因子] --&gt; I&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 传统视角\n        A[股票 60%] --&gt; D[组合]\n        B[债券 30%] --&gt; D\n        C[商品 10%] --&gt; D\n    end\n    subgraph 因子视角\n        E[市场因子] --&gt; I[组合]\n        F[价值因子] --&gt; I\n        G[动量因子] --&gt; I\n        H[套利因子] --&gt; I\n    end</pre><p><strong>因子视角的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>揭示看似不同资产类别之间的共同风险驱动</li>\n<li>避免&quot;伪分散化&quot;——持有多种资产但暴露于相同因子</li>\n<li>更精确地控制风险预算</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"实施因子配置的方式\">实施因子配置的方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>精确度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Smart Beta ETF</td>\n<td>单因子/多因子指数基金</td>\n<td>0.1-0.4%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因子倾斜（Factor Tilting）</td>\n<td>在指数基础上超配因子暴露</td>\n<td>0.05-0.2%</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多空因子组合</td>\n<td>做多高因子暴露、做空低因子暴露</td>\n<td>0.5-1.5%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因子择时</td>\n<td>根据估值/宏观周期动态调整</td>\n<td>取决于实施</td>\n<td>尝试高但极难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"因子配置的最佳实践\">因子配置的最佳实践</h3><p><strong>1. 多因子优于单因子</strong></p>\n<p>因子之间通常具有低相关性甚至负相关性（如价值与动量的相关系数约为 -0.5），组合持有多因子可以显著降低因子特异风险。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 全球实施优于单一市场</strong></p>\n<p>在全球范围实施因子策略可增加样本量、降低数据挖掘风险、分散单一市场特异风险。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 长期持有、穿越周期</strong></p>\n<p>因子溢价的实现需要 10 年以上的投资期限。短期内单因子可能大幅跑输市场。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 关注实施成本</strong></p>\n<p>高换手率因子（如短期动量）的实施成本可能吞噬大部分理论溢价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2025-2026-年因子表现快照\">2025-2026 年因子表现快照</h2><p>根据最新数据，2025 年全球因子表现呈现&quot;旧因子回归&quot;的特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>价值因子</strong>：在国际市场强劲复苏，MSCI World Value 跑赢 Growth 约 8%</li>\n<li><strong>动量因子</strong>：在 2025 年上半年受到趋势反转冲击（科技股见顶），下半年恢复</li>\n<li><strong>质量/低波动</strong>：在地缘不确定性中表现优异</li>\n<li><strong>规模因子</strong>：小盘股相对大盘股表现平淡，受利率环境压制</li>\n</ul>\n<p>广发证券研报指出，2026 年宏观环境将从&quot;叙事交易&quot;向&quot;因子交易&quot;回归，增长和通胀因子的 Sharpe ratio 将提升，模型建议从风险平价角度超配增长通胀敏感的股商资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因子投资的陷阱\">因子投资的陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"数据挖掘问题\">数据挖掘问题</h3><p>学术界已发现超过 400 个声称有效的因子（Harvey, Liu, Zhu 2016）。其中绝大多数可能只是 p-hacking 的结果。筛选真因子的标准：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>t 统计量 &gt; 3.0（而非传统的 1.96）</li>\n<li>多个独立数据集复制</li>\n<li>有清晰的经济学逻辑</li>\n<li>发表后不立即消失</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"拥挤交易风险\">拥挤交易风险</h3><p>当过多资金追逐同一因子，溢价可能被暂时消除甚至反转。2020 年动量因子的崩溃就是一个例子——大量量化基金同时持有相似的动量组合，在市场反转时集体出逃。</p>\n<h3 id=\"因子择时的诱惑\">因子择时的诱惑</h3><p>学术研究表明因子估值（如 HML 的价值利差 value spread）对未来因子收益有预测能力。但择时的实施远比理论困难——多数因子择时策略在实盘中表现远逊于回测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本节小结\">本节小结</h2><p>因子模型将资产配置从&quot;选资产类别&quot;推进到&quot;选风险因子&quot;——这是一次重要的认知升级。对个人投资者而言，核心建议是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>认识到预期收益来自承担系统性因子风险</li>\n<li>通过低成本 Smart Beta 产品获得多因子暴露</li>\n<li>保持长期纪律，不要在因子低谷时放弃</li>\n<li>全球分散实施，降低单一市场依赖</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"因子模型与预期收益","id":"因子模型与预期收益"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 CAPM 到多因子世界","id":"从-capm-到多因子世界"},{"level":3,"text":"从单因子到多因子的逻辑","id":"从单因子到多因子的逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"Fama-French 三因子模型","id":"fama-french-三因子模型"},{"level":3,"text":"模型结构","id":"模型结构"},{"level":3,"text":"因子构造的具体方法","id":"因子构造的具体方法"},{"level":3,"text":"三因子模型的解释力","id":"三因子模型的解释力"},{"level":2,"text":"Fama-French 五因子模型","id":"fama-french-五因子模型"},{"level":3,"text":"五因子 vs 三因子","id":"五因子-vs-三因子"},{"level":2,"text":"AQR 因子框架","id":"aqr-因子框架"},{"level":3,"text":"AQR 核心因子","id":"aqr-核心因子"},{"level":3,"text":"因子溢价的历史规模","id":"因子溢价的历史规模"},{"level":2,"text":"因子溢价的经济解释","id":"因子溢价的经济解释"},{"level":3,"text":"风险解释 vs 行为解释","id":"风险解释-vs-行为解释"},{"level":3,"text":"实务立场：因子溢价是否会持续？","id":"实务立场-因子溢价是否会持续"},{"level":2,"text":"因子的时序变化与周期性","id":"因子的时序变化与周期性"},{"level":3,"text":"因子有自己的\"周期\"","id":"因子有自己的-周期"},{"level":3,"text":"价值因子的\"失落十年\"","id":"价值因子的-失落十年"},{"level":2,"text":"如何用因子指导资产配置","id":"如何用因子指导资产配置"},{"level":3,"text":"因子配置 vs 资产类别配置","id":"因子配置-vs-资产类别配置"},{"level":3,"text":"实施因子配置的方式","id":"实施因子配置的方式"},{"level":3,"text":"因子配置的最佳实践","id":"因子配置的最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"2025-2026 年因子表现快照","id":"2025-2026-年因子表现快照"},{"level":2,"text":"因子投资的陷阱","id":"因子投资的陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"数据挖掘问题","id":"数据挖掘问题"},{"level":3,"text":"拥挤交易风险","id":"拥挤交易风险"},{"level":3,"text":"因子择时的诱惑","id":"因子择时的诱惑"},{"level":2,"text":"本节小结","id":"本节小结"}],"prev":{"title":"有效市场假说与资产定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/theory-foundations/efficient-market-hypothesis"},"next":{"title":"战略资产配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/portfolio-construction/strategic-asset-allocation"}}